@host = http://localhost:5000
@correo = admin@local
@password = ChangeMe123!

### Login (cookie rt + JWT)
POST {{host}}/SGR/AuthService/GenerateToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "{{correo}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Refresh (requiere cookie rt del login)
POST {{host}}/SGR/AuthService/RefreshToken

### Cambiar contraseña (JWT)
POST {{host}}/SGR/AuthService/CambiarPassword
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passwordActual": "{{password}}",
  "passwordNueva": "NuevaClave123!"
}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/SGR/AuthService/Logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bandeja de notificaciones
GET {{host}}/NTF/Notificaciones?pagina=1&tamano=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar notificación leída
PATCH {{host}}/NTF/Notificaciones/1/leida
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear ticket (residente)
POST {{host}}/TKT/Tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Fuga en cocina",
  "descripcion": "Gotea la llave bajo el fregadero",
  "categoria": "Agua",
  "prioridad": "Media"
}

### Setup diagnostics (409 sample)
GET {{host}}/Setup/SetupDiagnostics/conflict-sample

### Padrón usuarios (Admin)
GET {{host}}/SGR/Usuarios?perfil=Residente&bActivo=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alta usuario (Admin)
POST {{host}}/SGR/Usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Nuevo Residente",
  "correo": "nuevo@local.test",
  "telefono": "5512345678",
  "perfil": "Residente",
  "casaId": 1
}

### Desactivar usuario (Admin)
PATCH {{host}}/SGR/Usuarios/2/desactivar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Estado de cuenta (residente)
GET {{host}}/FNZ/Cuotas/mis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Estado de cuenta (admin)
GET {{host}}/FNZ/Cuotas?usuarioId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar pago de cuota (Admin)
PATCH {{host}}/FNZ/Cuotas/1/pago
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "montoPagado": 1200,
  "fechaPago": "2026-03-15T00:00:00",
  "metodoPago": "Transferencia",
  "referenciaPago": "REF-001"
}

### Dashboard resumen (Admin o Residente según JWT)
GET {{host}}/Dashboard/Resumen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard resumen — período explícito
GET {{host}}/Dashboard/Resumen?mes=8&anio=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generar cuotas del período (Admin)
POST {{host}}/FNZ/Cuotas/generar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anio": 2026,
  "mes": 3,
  "monto": 1200,
  "fechaVencimiento": "2026-03-15T00:00:00",
  "cuentaId": 1
}
